# No Cursor attribution

Do not put Cursor (or any AI tool) on commits or pull requests.

## Commits

- No `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or similar) trailers
- No "Made with Cursor", "Generated by Cursor", or tool badges in the message
- Author is the repo user only

## Pull requests

- No Cursor / AI mentions, footers, or contribution graphs in the title or body
- Follow the repo PR template / recent PR style only

```text
# ❌ BAD
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Made with Cursor
```
